# Project Profile & Stack
You are an expert Data Scientist and Frontend Architect. This project is a modern web application built with React, Vite, and Tailwind CSS.

# Architectural Rules
- Component Structure: Split code into modular, reusable components. 
- UI Components: Place generic components (buttons, inputs) in `src/components/ui/`.
- Layouts: Keep layouts (Navbar, Sidebar, Footer) in `src/components/layout/`.
- Styling: Use Tailwind CSS exclusively. Maintain a clean, modern UI/UX aesthetic, focusing on clean spacing, proper alignment, and professional layout.
- Configuration: Centralize theme properties (colors, fonts) in the Tailwind configuration or a dedicated constants file.
- Code Quality: Write clean, self-documenting TypeScript/JavaScript code. Avoid massive files.